{"id":"84fe0214dffac7e4","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-subtraction-function.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Truncated Subtraction","display":"df-subtraction-function — Primitive Recursive Truncated Subtraction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-subtraction-function","aliases":["88-df-subtraction-function"],"display":"df-subtraction-function — Primitive Recursive Truncated Subtraction","depends_on":["[[88-df-zero-function]]","[[88-df-projection-function]]","[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]","[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-subtraction-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-subtraction-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subtraction-function — Primitive Recursive Truncated Subtraction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69f9994fe732757d\" href=\"?note=69f9994fe732757d\" title=\"88-df-zero-function\">88-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"78a1a0c916e243a2\" href=\"?note=78a1a0c916e243a2\" title=\"88-df-projection-function\">88-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73df252510501ed2\" href=\"?note=73df252510501ed2\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme\">88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景为集合论元语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,n,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,n,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。数值函数按本书的同元数元组接口表示，一元点值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span> 是该接口的简写。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_k,P_i^k,\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k,\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\">\\(Z_k,P_i^k,\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k,\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"69f9994fe732757d\" href=\"?note=69f9994fe732757d\" title=\"88-df-zero-function\">88-df-zero-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"78a1a0c916e243a2\" href=\"?note=78a1a0c916e243a2\" title=\"88-df-projection-function\">88-df-projection-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"73df252510501ed2\" href=\"?note=73df252510501ed2\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme\">88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a>；该递归方案的递归参数位于第一位。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,\\operatorname{pred},d,\\operatorname{sub}\">\\(r,\\operatorname{pred},d,\\operatorname{sub}\\)</span> 由下式按顺序构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 将截断减法的递归变量放在第一位，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y\">\\(x\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y\\)</span> 是所构造截断减法的中缀记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nr&amp;:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;r(0,a)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;r(n+1,a)&amp;\\coloneqq n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;\\operatorname{pred}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq r(n,0),\\\\\nd&amp;:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;d(0,x)&amp;\\coloneqq x,&amp;\nd(n+1,x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pred}(d(n,x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}&amp;:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq d(y,x),&amp;x\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nr&amp;:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;r(0,a)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;r(n+1,a)&amp;\\coloneqq n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;\\operatorname{pred}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq r(n,0),\\\\\nd&amp;:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;d(0,x)&amp;\\coloneqq x,&amp;\nd(n+1,x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pred}(d(n,x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}&amp;:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,&amp;\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq d(y,x),&amp;x\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}(0)=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{pred}(n+1)=n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,0)=x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y+1)=\\operatorname{pred}(\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pred}(0)=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{pred}(n+1)=n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,0)=x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y+1)=\\operatorname{pred}(\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(r)\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(\\operatorname{pred})\n\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(d)\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(\\operatorname{sub}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(r)\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(\\operatorname{pred})\n\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(d)\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(\\operatorname{sub}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)=0\\longleftrightarrow x\\le y,\\qquad\ny\\le x\\longrightarrow\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)+y=x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)=0\\longleftrightarrow x\\le y,\\qquad\ny\\le x\\longrightarrow\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)+y=x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地补充定义。r 的基函数是 Z₁，步函数取三元输入的第一个投影；d 的基函数是恒等投影，步函数是 pred 与先前值投影的复合。原始递归方案分别给出唯一的 r、d，复合与参数置换给出 pred、sub，因此四项原始递归性成立。末行性质由递归变量归纳得到，不使用 min 或 max。</p>\n<p>标准递推依据：<a href=\"https://www.andrew.cmu.edu/user/kk3n/recursionclass/chap2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CMU《Primitive Recursion》§2.6.5–2.6.6</a>，印刷第 13 页／PDF 第 6 页；已按本书递归参数在第一位及元组图的接口适配，未据此声称核验本书原文。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69f9994fe732757d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"78a1a0c916e243a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-projection-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme","status":"resolved","id":"73df252510501ed2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69f9994fe732757d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z_k,P_i^k,\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k,\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k$ 分别取 [[88-df-zero-function]]、[[88-df-projection-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]；该递归方案的递归参数位于第一位。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"78a1a0c916e243a2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z_k,P_i^k,\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k,\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k$ 分别取 [[88-df-zero-function]]、[[88-df-projection-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]；该递归方案的递归参数位于第一位。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme","status":"resolved","id":"73df252510501ed2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z_k,P_i^k,\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k,\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k$ 分别取 [[88-df-zero-function]]、[[88-df-projection-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]；该递归方案的递归参数位于第一位。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z_k,P_i^k,\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k,\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k$ 分别取 [[88-df-zero-function]]、[[88-df-projection-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]；该递归方案的递归参数位于第一位。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"a,n,x,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"Z_k,P_i^k,\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k,\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k","display":false},{"tex":"r,\\operatorname{pred},d,\\operatorname{sub}","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"x\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nr&:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,&r(0,a)&\\coloneqq0,&r(n+1,a)&\\coloneqq n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,&\\operatorname{pred}(n)&\\coloneqq r(n,0),\\\\\nd&:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,&d(0,x)&\\coloneqq x,&\nd(n+1,x)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pred}(d(n,x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}&:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,&\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)&\\coloneqq d(y,x),&x\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pred}(0)=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{pred}(n+1)=n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,0)=x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y+1)=\\operatorname{pred}(\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(r)\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(\\operatorname{pred})\n\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(d)\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(\\operatorname{sub}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)=0\\longleftrightarrow x\\le y,\\qquad\ny\\le x\\longrightarrow\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)+y=x.","display":true}],"bytes":2613,"backlinks":[{"id":"ed30454d43d18f4c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[88-df-subtraction-function]] 的二元截断减法，$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2$ 取 [[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。$+$ 是元语言自然数加法；原始递归方案取 [[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]。"},{"id":"867fa39cfa0d7a32","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[88-df-subtraction-function]] 的二元截断减法，$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2$ 取 [[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。"},{"id":"b301b626e1a834ac","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数集合的 $\\max$ 取 [[88-df-max-function]]，$\\mathbin{\\dot{-}}$ 取 [[88-df-subtraction-function]]；$t\\ge1$ 时指数候选集包含 $0$ 且以 $t$ 为界。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-df-subtraction-function]]"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\